      "id": "e-cori-runtime",
      "kind": "evidence",
      "text": "Built 2026-11-22 in Alchemy (the Cori component: the butterfly and her plate, size and see-through as settings; she perches on her plate in Fab and the Web preview): she sparks out of the orb, lands on top edges of what matters (the lit action, the selected tab, a current link), rests on frame corners, visits the orb; idles every 8–20 s (loop 40 / corner 35 / orb 25); a section change and the orb's ? send her; each landing sends a pulse; a leader from her plate while she sits; drawn from the kit butterfly with the projection (rings from the orb, rim shimmer, pulse-lit rim, wing dropouts), 85% see-through. Calm: no flight. Not yet: her tour and per-spot lines (the user's), landing on the rail (it's at the screen's top edge)."
